<title>UK: Sweden adds NZ$50 million to two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden adds NZ$50 million to two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, lead manager Hambros Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>There is a new 100.87 issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    *NZ$200 MLN   COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    30.OCT.yr</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.87    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL NZ$150 MLN LAUNCHED 04.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
